# Module 41 – AI Knowledge Indexing, Audit & Performance Dashboard

This module completes the operational side of the HI-TECH College AI Governance Centre. It gives administrators visibility into whether chatbot knowledge articles have been indexed correctly, allows failed indexing jobs to be retried, and provides audit, prompt-version and usage reports.

It builds on Modules 39 and 40. The main addition is a persistent indexing queue: indexing work is recorded in the database instead of relying on an administrator manually calling the embedding service.

New components:

1. Knowledge indexing queue and retry management.
2. Embedding model/version tracking.
3. Article re-index and bulk re-index operations.
4. Prompt version history and rollback.
5. Filterable AI audit log.
6. Usage breakdown by user, role, model and operation.
7. AI feedback and retrieval performance reports.

## 1. Prisma schema additions

Add these enums and models to `apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma`.

```

enum AIIndexingStatus {
  PENDING
  PROCESSING
  INDEXED
  FAILED
  CANCELLED
}

enum AIPromptAction {
  CREATED
  PUBLISHED
  ARCHIVED
  ROLLED_BACK
}

model AIKnowledgeIndexJob {
  id              String           @id @default(uuid())
  institutionId   String
  articleId       String
  status          AIIndexingStatus @default(PENDING)
  attempts        Int              @default(0)
  maxAttempts     Int              @default(5)
  lastError       String?
  embeddingModel  String?
  requestedById   String?
  startedAt       DateTime?
  completedAt     DateTime?
  nextRetryAt     DateTime         @default(now())
  createdAt       DateTime         @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime         @updatedAt

  @@index([institutionId, status, nextRetryAt])
  @@index([institutionId, articleId, createdAt])
}

model AIPromptVersionHistory {
  id             String         @id @default(uuid())
  institutionId  String
  promptId       String
  promptName     String
  version        Int
  action         AIPromptAction
  snapshot       Json
  changedById    String?
  createdAt      DateTime       @default(now())

  @@index([institutionId, promptName, createdAt])
  @@index([institutionId, promptId])
}

```

Extend `ChatbotKnowledgeArticle` with:

```
