## 11. Connect indexing to knowledge article publishing

In `apps/api/src/routes/chatbotAdmin.ts`, after an article is published or edited while published, enqueue its indexing job:

```
import { enqueueKnowledgeIndexing } from "../services/aiIndexingQueue";

await enqueueKnowledgeIndexing({
  institutionId,
  articleId: article.id,
  requestedById: actorId,
});
```

When an article is archived, remove its embedding using the existing `removeKnowledgeEmbedding()` service and cancel any pending indexing jobs for that article.

Also update the retrieval service to exclude articles unless:

```
where: {
  institutionId,
  status: "PUBLISHED",
  indexingStatus: "INDEXED",
  embedding: { not: null },
}
```

This prevents an article that has not been indexed successfully from being treated as searchable knowledge.

